A Vulkan-based translation layer for Direct3D 7, 6, 5 and 3 which allows running 3D applications on Linux using Wine.
It uses DXVK's D3D9 backend as well as Wine's DDraw implementation (or the windows native DDraw) and acts as a
proxy between the two, providing a minimal D3D7/6/5/3-on-D3D9 implementation.
